title: sprawl_convergence_beat3
---
CASIMIR: Reid. I knew they'd send someone from Gray eventually.
VERA: Dad—
CASIMIR: Let me handle this, Vera.
REID: There's nothing to handle. Bureau wants her back. Reinstatement. Standard process.
CASIMIR: There's no process here. She left. That was her choice.
VERA: It's not that simple.
CASIMIR: Reid, you know me. We've worked together. Whatever they're paying—
REID: Don't finish that sentence.
IRIS: Question.
CASIMIR: Who are you?
IRIS: Doesn't matter. Can we fight our way out of this room?
REID: Not a conversation I'd recommend starting.
IRIS: Can we run?
REID: I've already logged the location.
IRIS: Then we talk.
VERA: Let her. Please.
CASIMIR: Vera—
VERA: Dad.
<<show_narration "The door came in fast.">>
<<set $case_1_beat3_complete = true>>
===
